  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mpv-android/mpv-android/zipball/2026-08-11",
  "body": "#### :warning: Please note :warning: \r\n \r\nBetter support for scoped storage has been added in most places.\r\nThe `api29` APK with a reduced API level is still available but will be removed eventually.\r\n\r\n## Change log\r\n\r\n- Features:\r\n  - Option to remember screen brightness (@obscenelyvague)\r\n  - Notification thumbnail is updated when playing new files\r\n  - Now includes libcurl for better HTTP streaming efficiency\r\n- Fixes:\r\n  - Connection failures to some TLS servers were resolved (mbedTLS bug)\r\n  - Various bug fixes and improvements\r\n\r\n**Note**: This release requires at least Android 6, up from Android 5.0 required by previous releases.\r\n\r\n## Full set of build dependencies\r\n* Android NDK r29\r\n* mbedtls 3.6.7\r\n* dav1d 1.5.4 (videolan/dav1d@54706fc6bc0cdecab7e9593974a4039cc038fca7)\r\n* ffmpeg 9.0 (ffmpeg/ffmpeg@d32b387f2b0a484599d4587d651891f0c63c4238)\r\n* libxml2 2.15.3\r\n* fontconfig 2.18.2\r\n* freetype 2.14.3\r\n* fribidi 1.0.16\r\n* harfbuzz 14.2.1\r\n* libunibreak 7.0\r\n* libass libass/libass@3087d2b2ffda76602a17f9b09d25cb8addc8d313\r\n* lua 5.2.4\r\n* libplacebo haasn/libplacebo@4d82c6898551068d4ae6a6b5538efcddc2c7cf64\r\n* curl 8.21.0\r\n* libmpv mpv-player/mpv@f4d13e1c2c91f3a56e589aef9cb44cbc02e26e47\r\n* mpv-android ad98fc97ff1d25e217389e7238a1abda8c13a6c4\r\n\r\n\r\n### :arrow_down: Which APK do I download? :arrow_down: \r\n\r\nYou generally want to get **`arm64-v8a`**. Try `armeabi-v7a` for old devices. Or `x86` otherwise.\r\nIf you are unsure then the `universal` APK will work everywhere.\r\n\r\n**Note**: Android TV is supported, but only available on F-Droid or by installing the APK manually using e.g. [Downloader](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.esaba.downloader).",
